{"qid": "tt_t1_00002", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 14218.73, "n_tokens": 238, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.52, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 357, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "对方律师说得对，2026年起诉不能再直接依照《合同法》第五十二条处理。\n\n理由如下：\n\n1. **《合同法》已废止**\n   《中华人民共和国合同法》自2021年1月1日《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起废止。2026年起诉时，法院审理合同纠纷应适用《民法典》及相关司法解释，而不再适用已失效的《合同法》。\n\n2. **法律适用的时间规则**\n   根据《民法典》时间效力的相关规定，一般原则是：法律事实发生在《民法典》施行前的，适用当时的法律（即《合同法》）；但《民法典》施行后新受理的案件，若法律事实发生在施行前，通常仍适用旧法，除非属于司法解释规定的例外情形。因此，2017年发生的事实，**实体判断标准**可能仍参照当时的《合同法》，但**裁判依据**会表述为《民法典》或相关司法解释，而非直接援引已废止的", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 14.216, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_52", "score": 0.8719, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 52, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_584", "score": 0.2197, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 584, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民终1798号_1", "score": 0.1661, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民终1798号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民再437号_1", "score": 0.1629, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民再437号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1721号_1", "score": 0.1629, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）闽01民再1721号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民初1816号_1", "score": 0.1604, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民初181