{"qid": "tt_t1_00026", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.18, "n_tokens": 242, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.48, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 364, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "对方律师的说法更准确，但需要区分两个层面来说明。\n\n**一、关于《合同法》第五十二条本身**\n\n《合同法》已于2021年1月1日随《民法典》施行而废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确废止《合同法》）。因此，2026年起诉时，法院不会再直接以\"《合同法》第五十二条\"作为裁判依据。\n\n**二、关于法律适用的时间效力**\n\n根据《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》：\n\n- 一般原则：民法典施行**前**的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，**适用当时的法律、司法解释**（即2016年时有效的《合同法》）。\n- 也就是说，如果合同订立、履行等法律事实发生在2016年（民法典施行前），实体上仍应适用当时的《合同法》，包括其第五十二条关于合同无效的规定。\n\n**三、结论**\n\n1. **实体规则**：201", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_52", "score": 0.8734, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 52, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_584", "score": 0.221, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 584, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民终1798号_1", "score": 0.168, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民终1798号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民再437号_1", "score": 0.1648, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民再437号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_1", "score": 0.1575, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2502号_1", "score": 0.1572, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020