{"qid": "tt_t2_00014", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 65.02, "n_tokens": 181, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.52, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 272, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "结论：该条内容并未“失效”，但《合同法》本身已自2021年1月1日起废止，相关内容已被《民法典》吸收。现行法依据是《民法典》第五百七十七条，条文内容与您查询到的《合同法》第一百零七条一致。\n\n依据：\n- 《民法典》第五百七十七条：当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定的，应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任。\n- 《合同法》第一百零七条原有相同规定，但因《民法典》施行，《合同法》已废止，不再作为现行裁判依据单独引用。\n\n因此，若现在处理合同违约问题，应引用《民法典》第五百七十七条，而不是《合同法》第一百零七条。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.064, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_107", "score": 0.9, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 107, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_577", "score": 0.6471, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 577, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_584", "score": 0.3504, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 584, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_563", "score": 0.261, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 563, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民初1902号_0", "score": 0.2517, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民初1902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.2517, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_114", "score": 0.2251, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 114, "case_no": null}, {"doc_i