{"qid": "tt_t2_00020", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 63.05, "n_tokens": 227, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.52, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 341, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "您查到的《侵权责任法》第六条内容本身是准确的，但**该法已经失效**，不能作为现行裁判依据。\n\n**一、失效情况**\n\n《中华人民共和国侵权责任法》自2010年7月1日起施行，自2021年1月1日《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确规定废止包括《侵权责任法》在内的九部法律）。因此，2021年1月1日以后发生的侵权纠纷，应适用《民法典》侵权责任编。\n\n**二、对应的现行条文**\n\n您引用的内容对应现行《民法典》第一千一百六十五条第一款：\n\n> 行为人因过错侵害他人民事权益造成损害的，应当承担侵权责任。\n\n与旧法第六条相比，现行条文有一处实质变化：**增加了\"造成损害的\"这一要件**。即构成过错侵权责任，除行为、过错、因果关系外，还须有实际损害", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.062, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_侵权责任法_2009_6", "score": 0.8705, "type": "provision", "law": "侵权责任法", "article": 6, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1165", "score": 0.603, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1165, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1166", "score": 0.4423, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1166, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_577", "score": 0.1519, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 577, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_1", "score": 0.123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_1", "score": 0.123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_1", "score": 0.123, "typ