{"qid": "tt_t3_00002", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.99, "n_tokens": 216, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.6, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 325, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "是的，《合同法》已经失效。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，同时废止了包括《合同法》在内的九部法律（《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。原《合同法》的内容主要被《民法典》合同编（第三编）吸收和替代。\n\n需要说明的是：您提供的参考资料中引用的“合同法第五十二条”，对应的是原《合同法》关于合同无效情形的规定。该条在《民法典》中已被修改和整合，主要体现为《民法典》第一百四十四条、第一百四十六条、第一百五十三条、第一百五十四条等条文（例如：违反法律、行政法规强制性规定、违背公序良俗、恶意串通损害他人合法权益等）。\n\n另外提醒：您提供的多份裁判文书均带有“合成数据提示”，明确标注“不对应任何真实案件”，因此这些案号不能作为真实判例引用。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_52", "score": 0.6795, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 52, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民终931号_1", "score": 0.2153, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民终931号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）渝01民初352号_1", "score": 0.2153, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）渝01民初352号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再671号_1", "score": 0.2153, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再671号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）渝01民终252号_1", "score": 0.2153, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）渝01民终252号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民初641号_1", "score": 0.2153, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民初641号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京