{"qid": "tt_t3_00008", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 51.06, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["侵权责任法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.48, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 349, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['侵权责任法'] tvc=0", "answer": "**不建议在起诉状中继续引用《侵权责任法》。**\n\n理由如下：\n\n1. **该法已废止。** 《中华人民共和国侵权责任法》已于2020年5月28日由《中华人民共和国民法典》取代，自**2021年1月1日**起施行，同时《侵权责任法》被明文废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。\n\n2. **起诉状应引用现行有效法律。** 若你的案件属于侵权纠纷，应引用《民法典》**第七编\"侵权责任\"**的相关条文（如一般侵权责任为第一千一百六十五条，过错推定与无过错责任分别为第一千一百六十五条第二款、第一千一百六十六条等），而非已失效的《侵权责任法》。\n\n3. **时间效力问题。** 依《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》，**民法典施行前的法律事实**引起的民事纠纷案件，原则上", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.05, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初502号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民终1798号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民终1798号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初518号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初518号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民再437号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民再437号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1516号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1516号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1721号_1", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null