{"qid": "tt_t3_00014", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.36, "n_tokens": 182, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 274, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "是的，《继承法》已经失效。\n\n《中华人民共和国继承法》自1985年10月1日起施行，后经《中华人民共和国民法典》施行而废止。根据《民法典》第一千二百六十条的规定，本法自2021年1月1日起施行，《中华人民共和国继承法》同时废止。因此，自2021年1月1日起，原《继承法》不再作为独立法律适用，相关内容已被《民法典》\"继承编\"吸收和替代。\n\n需要说明的是，上述参考资料中未包含《民法典》继承编的具体条文内容，如需针对具体继承问题（如法定继承顺序、遗嘱形式要件、遗产范围等）作进一步分析，建议补充具体案情，我可以依据《民法典》继承编的相关规定为你解答。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_0", "score": 0.7023, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.7023, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民终665号_0", "score": 0.696, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民终665号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民再332号_1", "score": 0.0867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民再332号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民再686号_1", "score": 0.0867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民再686号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）川01民初1538号_1", "score": 0.0866, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）川01民初1538号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1746号_1", "score": 0.0866, "type": "