{"qid": "tt_t3_00020", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 33.05, "n_tokens": 224, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["物权法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.24, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 336, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['物权法'] tvc=0", "answer": "可以引用，但要注意《物权法》已于 **2021年1月1日** 被《中华人民共和国民法典》施行后废止，原《物权法》条文已被《民法典》物权编吸收、替代。\n\n就你给的参考资料而言：\n\n- **《物权法》第三十九条**：对应《民法典》**第二百四十条**（所有权人对自己的不动产或者动产，依法享有占有、使用、收益和处分的权利）。\n- **《物权法》第九条**：对应《民法典》**第二百零九条**（不动产物权的设立、变更、转让和消灭，经依法登记，发生效力；未经登记，不发生效力，但是法律另有规定的除外）。\n\n所以：\n\n1. **如果案件法律事实发生在2021年1月1日之前**，可以引用当时有效的《物权法》第三十九条、第九条。\n2. **如果法律事实发生在2021年1月1日之后**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.032, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_物权法_2007_39", "score": 0.6795, "type": "provision", "law": "物权法", "article": 39, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_物权法_2007_9", "score": 0.6065, "type": "provision", "law": "物权法", "article": 9, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初502号_1", "score": 0.3241, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初518号_1", "score": 0.3241, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初518号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民初1816号_1", "score": 0.3234, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民初1816号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1490号_1", "score": 0.3234, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1490号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）津