{"qid": "tt_t3_00026", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 31.62, "n_tokens": 224, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["收养法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 336, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['收养法'] tvc=0", "answer": "是的，《收养法》已经失效。\n\n《中华人民共和国收养法》已于2020年5月28日被《中华人民共和国民法典》吸收替代。根据《民法典》第一千二百六十条的规定，《民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，《收养法》同时废止。收养相关的条件、程序等内容，现规定在《民法典》婚姻家庭编\"收养\"一章（第一千零九十三条至第一千一百一十八条）中。\n\n关于收养人条件，原《收养法》第六条要求收养人同时具备：无子女、有抚养教育被收养人的能力、未患有医学上认为不应当收养子女的疾病、年满三十周岁。这一实质内容被《民法典》第一千零九十八条继承，并在此基础上增加了一项\"无不利于被收养人健康成长的违法犯罪记录\"，即现行收养人条件为五项。\n\n因此，如果对方仍以《收养法》第六条作为依据，其引用的法律名称已经过", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.031, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_收养法_1998修正_6", "score": 0.6481, "type": "provision", "law": "收养法", "article": 6, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤01民初1805号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤01民初1805号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民初2546号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民初2546号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民初1830号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民初1830号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2452号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2452号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤03民初1970号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤03民初1970号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）闽01民终2589号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）闽01民终2589号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2486号_1", "score": 0.103, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2486号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t4_00002", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.21, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.38095238095238093, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 348, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=溯及力判断 as_of=2016-05-20 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "结论：**原则上适用行为发生时的法律（即当时的《合同法》等旧法），而不是《民法典》**；但具体还要看纠纷类型和是否有司法解释的特别规定。\n\n**一、基本依据：法不溯及既往**\n\n《民法典》本身没有规定“溯及适用”，其时间效力问题由最高人民法院专门规定。核心规则是：\n\n- **法律不溯及既往**：民事纠纷原则上适用行为发生时的法律。\n- 最高人民法院《关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》（法释〔2020〕15号）第1条明确：\n  - 民法典施行（2021年1月1日）**前**的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，**适用当时的法律、司法解释**；\n  - 民法典施行**后**的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，适用民法典；\n  - 施行前的法律事实**持续至**施行后，适用民法典（但法律", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民终1796号_0", "score": 0.7274, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民终1796号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.6387, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民初1902号_0", "score": 0.634, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民初1902号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.5672, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 10, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民事诉讼法_2023修正_122", "score": 0.4748, "type": "provision", "law": "民事诉讼法", "article": 122, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民再249号_1", "score": 0.3794, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民再